"at0tr0s1uw\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"Model\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1tjql1yaa040wilpytaqnu30dwbyhf68lxc1m4me2dd8d5c5f8gsacqhtys7ef6stzpl\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1tjql1yaa040wilpytaqnu30dwbyhf68lxc1t9n9r69ltzqpw5h7wtokw7j7o6ehtb8i\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"axlf30ue7z\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"With video input (USD \u002F M tokens)\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1tjql1yaa040wilpytaqnu30dwbyhf68lxc1t9n9r69ltzqpw5h7wtokw7j7o6ehtb8i\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc12ms92kajttietsfek45jan5mzyltcace\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"axqql0ug62\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"60% off the list price\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":\"true\"}},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc12ms92kajttietsfek45jan5mzyltcace\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc15vwdp98it8wdmyznzn1v9lok3nievi0l\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"atjcv0sah8\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"3.50\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc15vwdp98it8wdmyznzn1v9lok3nievi0l\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc19n5u3fs7b5pl0phyn9oo5ogjk4yr9fhz\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"auljk0sr8v\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"480p \u002F 720p\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc19n5u3fs7b5pl0phyn9oo5ogjk4yr9fhz\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc1avemohaizq54sbb97ib5n5kv2fo4s4gz\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"auiya0sqbz\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"0.84\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc1avemohaizq54sbb97ib5n5kv2fo4s4gz\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc1gdm3tz70f39zinlbkuzn6g2olmbahvwz\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"atfi40s8h4\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"1.40\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc1gdm3tz70f39zinlbkuzn6g2olmbahvwz\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc1m4me2dd8d5c5f8gsacqhtys7ef6stzpl\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"axyus0ukd2\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"Seedance 2.0 mini\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc1m4me2dd8d5c5f8gsacqhtys7ef6stzpl\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc1t9n9r69ltzqpw5h7wtokw7j7o6ehtb8i\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"ayci60uqaj\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"2.10\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1uut26o4w31oksf62nwyp7ytphj6fh1o6xc1t9n9r69ltzqpw5h7wtokw7j7o6ehtb8i\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1z3p1y066rjv40gjsem883h8p3mucvtzbxc18y63ddabma6l3sl92rtba8y10v9jjkwn\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"at7jf0s4jw\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"From 14:00 (UTC+8) on August 7, 2026 to 14:00 (UTC+8) on October 7, 2026\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1z3p1y066rjv40gjsem883h8p3mucvtzbxc18y63ddabma6l3sl92rtba8y10v9jjkwn\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"},\"xr1z3p1y066rjv40gjsem883h8p3mucvtzbxc1nuo6qpb5fvv039plaedm8f8j8gfas525\":{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"*\",\"attributes\":{\"lineId\":\"asf6i0rsu1\",\"lmkr\":\"1\"}},{\"insert\":\"Campaign period\\n\"}],\"zoneId\":\"xr1z3p1y066rjv40gjsem883h8p3mucvtzbxc1nuo6qpb5fvv039plaedm8f8j8gfas525\",\"zoneType\":\"Z\"}}}","ContentType":"json","EnContent":"","Index":14713884255232,"Type":0,"SecondNav":null,"CreatedTime":"2026-09-25T15:36:06Z","UpdatedTime":"2026-09-28T05:31:10Z","Status":2,"HasFavorite":false,"FirstPublishedTime":"2026-09-28T05:31:10Z","RedirectInfo":null,"ReuseDocumentVersionList":[],"Language":"en","BusinessID":121627,"MDContent":"This topic describes the limited\\-time discount campaign for Dreamina Seedance 2.0 fast and Dreamina Seedance 2.0 mini, including the campaign period, discounted prices, discount limits, billing method relationships, and frequently asked questions.\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003Ewarning\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EThis campaign applies only to token usage billed on a pay\\-as\\-you\\-go basis. Resource packs are prepaid products and are not eligible for this pay\\-as\\-you\\-go discount campaign.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"campaign-overview\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Campaign overview\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,6\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|Item |Dreamina Seedance 2.0 fast \u002F mini |\n|---|---|\n|Eligible output video resolution |480p and 720p |\n|Campaign period |From 14:00 (UTC+8) on August 7, 2026 to 14:00 (UTC+8) on October 7, 2026 |\n|Eligible users |Enterprise users |\n|Discount |* Seedance 2.0 fast: **25% off the list price**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* Seedance 2.0 mini: **60% off the list price** |\n|Discount cap |Starting at 14:00 (UTC+8) on September 18, 2026, **each model stops receiving the discount after its cumulative token usage billed at the discounted price reaches the specified cap**:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* Seedance 2.0 mini: 3.6 billion tokens\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* Seedance 2.0 fast: 1.2 billion tokens |\n|Discount method |During the campaign period, eligible pay\\-as\\-you\\-go token usage is automatically billed at the discounted price. You do not need to claim or apply for the discount. |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"how-to-participate\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n### How to participate\n\n\n1. To ensure stable service, you must meet either of the following requirements before activating a model:\n\n   * Recommended: Maintain a BytePlus account balance \\\u003E USD 30. Top\\-up entry: [Billing overview](https:\u002F\u002Fconsole.byteplus.com\u002Ffinance\u002Foverview).\n\n   * Recommended: Purchase a dedicated AI Savings Plan at the USD 30 tier or above. Purchase entry: [AI Savings Plan](https:\u002F\u002Fconsole.byteplus.com\u002Fcommon-buy\u002FAI-SavingsPlans%7C%7Cd9urs77og65q382arfog).\n\n2. Go to the [Model activation](https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002FopenManagement) page and activate the model for online inference. The campaign discount then applies automatically.\n\n3. For API instructions, see [Video Generation API](https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002Fdocs\u002FModelArk\u002F1520757).\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"campaign-period\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Campaign period\n\n\n* Seedance 2.0 fast \u002F mini: From 14:00 (UTC+8) on August 7, 2026 to 14:00 (UTC+8) on October 7, 2026.\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003ENote\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESeedance 2.0 fast and Seedance 2.0 mini return to the list price after the campaign ends or after the discount cap is reached.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Requests billed after the campaign ends, or later requests generated after the cumulative token usage billed at the discounted price reaches the cap for the corresponding model, are charged at the list price.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"discount-information\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Discount information\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"discounted-prices\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n### Discounted prices\n\nDuring the campaign, the discounted token unit prices for Seedance 2.0 fast and Seedance 2.0 mini apply automatically when eligible usage is billed.\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1.5,1.5,1,1.5,1.5,1.5,1.5\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|Model |Output video resolution |Discount |With video input (USD \u002F M tokens) ||Without video input (USD \u002F M tokens) ||\n|^^ |^^ |^^ |**List price** |**Discounted price** |**List price** |**Discounted price** |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|Seedance 2.0 fast |480p \u002F 720p |**25% off the list price** |3.30 |2.48 |5.60 |4.20 |\n|Seedance 2.0 mini |480p \u002F 720p |**60% off the list price** |2.10 |0.84 |3.50 |1.40 |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"discount-limits\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n### Discount limits\n\nThe Seedance 2.0 fast and Seedance 2.0 mini discounts apply only to enterprise users. After the cumulative token usage billed at the discounted price reaches the specified cap for each model, the discount no longer applies.\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|Model |Token usage cap |\n|---|---|\n|Seedance 2.0 fast |1.2 billion tokens |\n|Seedance 2.0 mini |3.6 billion tokens |\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003ENote\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EToken usage is counted separately for Seedance 2.0 fast and Seedance 2.0 mini. \u003Cstrong\u003EThe discount caps for the two models do not affect each other\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EThe system automatically counts all token usage billed at the discounted price from 14:00 (UTC+8) on September 18, 2026 to 14:00 (UTC+8) on October 7, 2026. \u003Cstrong\u003EToken usage consumed before 14:00 (UTC+8) on September 18, 2026 is not included in the cap calculation\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"relationship-between-resource-packs-ai-savings-plans-and-pay-as-you-go-billing\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Relationship between resource packs, AI Savings Plans, and pay\\-as\\-you\\-go billing\n\nBytePlus ModelArk provides three billing methods for Seedance 2.0 series models. Their relationship to this campaign is as follows.\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,2,3.5,4\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|Deduction order |Billing method |Nature |Relationship to the campaign |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|1 |Resource pack |A prepaid quota purchased at the list price. Resource pack tokens directly offset model token usage. |**Not eligible for this campaign** |\n|2 |AI Savings Plan |A committed spend amount that can offset pay\\-as\\-you\\-go token charges. |For Seedance 2.0 fast and Seedance 2.0 mini, the lowest applicable discount factor is selected from the campaign pay\\-as\\-you\\-go discount factor, the built\\-in AI Savings Plan discount factor, and your contract discount factor.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E For details, see [AI Savings Plans](https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.byteplus.com\u002Fen\u002Fdocs\u002Fbyteplus-platform\u002FAI_Savings_Plans#Z5ql8l9k). |\n|3 |Token\\-based pay\\-as\\-you\\-go billing |Charges are calculated from actual token usage and billed in real time. |**Eligible for this campaign** |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"additional-terms\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Additional terms\n\n\n1. Multiple accounts are considered the same user if they share the same mobile phone number, identity document number, or account ID, or are otherwise determined by BytePlus to be controlled by the same entity.\n\n2. BytePlus reserves the right to disqualify users who maliciously occupy campaign resources, place fraudulent bulk orders, use unconventional methods that compromise campaign fairness, or otherwise violate applicable service agreements and rules. BytePlus may reclaim campaign benefits and pursue legal liability when necessary.\n\n3. BytePlus may change or adjust the campaign based on operational requirements, including but not limited to the campaign rules, available product quantities, and campaign period. Refer to the latest campaign page and BytePlus notices. Services and benefits already granted before a rule change or adjustment are not affected.\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"frequently-asked-questions\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Frequently asked questions\n\n**Is every eligible API call during the campaign period billed at the discounted price?** \n\nFor Seedance 2.0 fast and Seedance 2.0 mini, if the usage is billed during the campaign period and the corresponding model has not reached its discount cap, it is charged at the campaign price automatically.\n\n**Do I need to claim or apply for the discount?** \n\nNo. After you meet the campaign requirements, eligible pay\\-as\\-you\\-go usage is automatically billed at the discounted price.\n\n**Can I receive the discount if I have already purchased a resource pack?** \n\nResource packs are prepaid quotas purchased at the list price and are deducted before pay\\-as\\-you\\-go charges. The discount does not apply to usage offset by a resource pack. After the resource pack quota is exhausted, or when no resource pack is available, eligible pay\\-as\\-you\\-go usage is billed at the campaign price.\n\n**Does an AI Savings Plan offset the amount before or after the campaign discount?** \n\nIt offsets the discounted amount. The pay\\-as\\-you\\-go charge is first calculated using the applicable price when the usage is billed, and the AI Savings Plan then offsets that discounted charge.\n\n**Is pay\\-as\\-you\\-go billing more cost\\-effective than a resource pack during the campaign?** \n\nYes. We recommend using pay\\-as\\-you\\-go billing. Pay\\-as\\-you\\-go billing is suitable for on\\-demand or fluctuating usage, while resource packs are more suitable for stable usage when you prefer to prepay for quota. Estimate your usage before selecting a billing method to avoid unused resource pack quota expiring.\n\n\n\n","SeoConfig":{"Title":"","Description":"","Keywords":"ModelArk"},"PDFURL":"https:\u002F\u002Feps-common-private-johor.dualstack.ap-southeast-1.tos.bytepluses.com\u002Fcloud-doc\u002Feps-doc-center-pdf\u002FModelArk_Limited-time%20discount%20campaign%20rules%20for%20Seedance%20models_1790573553.pdf","CanonicalURL":"\u002Fdocs\u002Fmodelark\u002Fdoc\u002Fseedance-2-0-mini-fast-limited-time-discount"},"nodeMap":null,"docListMap":null,"feedbackShow":false,"feedbackType":"unknow","feedbackContent":""}},"errors":null}</script><script defer="defer" src="//sf-bpcms.bytepluscdn.com/obj/byteplus-public-aiso/common-lib/static/js/index.1.0.0.4.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/lib-polyfill.f0944611.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/lib-arco.7da0ef0d.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/lib-axios.207ed7bd.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/lib-router.670aa775.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/146.c2df4d2e.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/main.15e69940.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script>!function(e){var r="function"==typeof window.slardarPluginImageReport?window.slardarPluginImageReport({debug:!1,sample_rate:1}):void 0;window.Slardar("init",{bid:e.bid,env:e.env,release:e.release,integrations:r?[r]:void 0,plugins:{blankScreen:{threshold:1,screenshot:!0,rootSelector:"#root"},ajax:{ignoreUrls:["mcs.snssdk.com","localhost"]},jsError:{ignoreErrors:["ResizeObserver loop limit exceeded"]},pageview:{extractPid:e.extractPid}}}),window.Slardar("start"),window.Slardar("sendEvent",{name:"ssr_level",categories:{site:"www",level:String((window._SSR_DATA||{}).renderLevel)}})}({bid:"byteplus_website",env:"production",release:"1.0.0.758"})</script></body></html>